# Pin line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform (the repo is text-only).
# Git objects are already LF (historically committed under autocrlf); this keeps every
# checkout and diff LF-consistent so the release-integrity manifest stays reproducible.
# Note: the manifest generator (snapshot_manifest.py) ALSO LF-normalises text before hashing,
# so manifest correctness does not depend on this file — this is hygiene / clean diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf
